  "notes": [
    "Briarwake hunters have distinct new vocal recordings: the Thornkeeper bellows and the Widow shrieks. Calls carry through the maze, alternate takes and return during extended pursuits. Dry grass-and-soil skitters replace the Widow\u2019s tonal creaking.",
    "The Widow has a larger body and much longer, bent legs, staggered eight-leg stepping, compact turns and sustained wall pursuit. Skitters follow its animated foot contacts, with separate soil and hedge sounds. Bite/grab damage lines up with fang contact and remains visible before results or spectating.",
    "Hunters use reachable approaches around hiding sheds, avoid climbing into shed roofs and cannot be swept inside by opening doors. Narrow passages use yielding to prevent hunter deadlocks.",
    "Everyone in a party must update to 0.23.23 for synchronized spider fold and wall-spread poses. Close the game and choose Check for updates, then Update & restart in your existing launcher. Settings are preserved."
  ],
